 "html": "<!--\r\n  Al Ihsan Specialist Hospital \u2014 Employee Record\r\n  Frappe / ERPNext Jinja Print Format\r\n  Doctype: Employee\r\n\r\n  HOW TO USE:\r\n  1. Go to: Setup > Printing > Print Format > New\r\n  2. Doc Type: Employee\r\n  3. Print Format Type: Jinja\r\n  4. Paste this entire file into the \"Print Format Builder\" / HTML field\r\n  5. If your instance uses a Letter Head with the hospital logo, you can\r\n     remove the <div class=\"letterhead\">...</div> block below and rely on\r\n     {{ letter_head }} instead \u2014 or keep this block for full control.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n  .employee-print { font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; color:#1C2733; font-size:10.5px; }\r\n  .employee-print .letterhead { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\r\n    border-bottom:1px solid #E1E5EB; padding-bottom:10px; margin-bottom:14px; }\r\n  .employee-print .letterhead img { height:42px; }\r\n  .employee-print .top-bar { height:4px; background:#0B2C6B; margin-bottom:2px; }\r\n  .employee-print .top-bar-accent { height:3px; width:35%; background:#F5941F; margin-bottom:14px; }\r\n\r\n  .employee-print .title-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:16px; }\r\n  .employee-print .title-row h1 { font-size:20px; color:#0B2C6B; margin:0 0 2px 0; }\r\n  .employee-print .title-row .sub { font-size:10px; color:#8A93A3; }\r\n  .employee-print .status-tag { display:inline-block; padding:5px 14px; border-radius:3px;\r\n    color:#fff; font-weight:bold; font-size:9.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; }\r\n  .status-active { background:#2E9E5B; }\r\n  .status-inactive { background:#B0362E; }\r\n  .status-left { background:#8A93A3; }\r\n\r\n  .employee-print .section-title { font-size:11px; font-weight:bold; color:#0B2C6B; text-transform:uppercase;\r\n    letter-spacing:.5px; border-bottom:1.4px solid #F5941F; padding-bottom:4px; margin:14px 0 8px 0; }\r\n\r\n  .employee-print .field-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); column-gap:14px; row-gap:9px; }\r\n  .employee-print .field-grid.two-col { grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr); }\r\n  .employee-print .field label { display:block; font-size:8px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8A93A3;\r\n    letter-spacing:.3px; margin-bottom:1px; }\r\n  .employee-print .field span { display:block; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:bold; color:#1C2733; }\r\n\r\n  .employee-print table.shift-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:8px; font-size:9.5px; }\r\n  .employee-print table.shift-table th { background:#0B2C6B; color:#fff; text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; }\r\n  .employee-print table.shift-table td { padding:6px 8px; border:0.5px solid #E1E5EB; }\r\n  .employee-print table.shift-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#F4F6F9; }\r\n\r\n  .employee-print .sig-block { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:40px; }\r\n  .employee-print .sig-block .sig { width:45%; border-top:1px solid #1C2733; padding-top:4px;\r\n    font-size:9px; color:#8A93A3; }\r\n\r\n  .employee-print .footer-note { margin-top:24px; padding-top:6px; border-top:0.6px solid #E1E5EB;\r\n    font-size:7.5px; color:#8A93A3; }\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"employee-print\">\r\n\r\n{{ letter_head }}\r\n\r\n  <!-- Title + status -->\r\n  <div class=\"title-row\">\r\n    <div>\r\n      <h1>Employee Record</h1>\r\n      <div class=\"sub\">Official HR Profile&nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;Employee ID: {{ doc.name }}</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div>\r\n      {% if doc.status == \"Active\" %}\r\n        <span class=\"status-tag status-active\">{{ doc.status }}</span>\r\n      {% elif doc.status == \"Left\" %}\r\n        <span class=\"status-tag status-left\">{{ doc.status }}</span>\r\n      {% else %}\r\n        <span class=\"status-tag status-inactive\">{{ doc.status }}</span>\r\n      {% endif %}\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Personal Information -->\r\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Personal Information</div>\r\n  <div class=\"field-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Full Name</label><span>{{ doc.employee_name }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Gender</label><span>{{ doc.gender }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Date of Birth</label><span>{{ doc.date_of_birth | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Mother's Name</label><span>{{ doc.custom_mother_name | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Marital Status</label><span>{{ doc.marital_status | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Blood Group</label><span>{{ doc.blood_group | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Contact Information -->\r\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Contact Information</div>\r\n  <div class=\"field-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Mobile</label><span>{{ doc.cell_number | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Personal Email</label><span>{{ doc.personal_email | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Current Address</label><span>{{ doc.current_address | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Employment Details -->\r\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Employment Details</div>\r\n  <div class=\"field-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Employee ID</label><span>{{ doc.name }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Department</label><span>{{ doc.department }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Designation</label><span>{{ doc.designation }}</span></div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Branch</label><span>{{ doc.branch | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Employment Type</label><span>{{ doc.employment_type | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Date of Joining</label><span>{{ doc.date_of_joining }}</span></div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Employment Status</label><span>{{ doc.status }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Notice Period (Days)</label><span>{{ doc.notice_number_of_days | default(\"0\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Create User Permission</label>\r\n      <span>{{ \"Granted\" if doc.create_user_permission else \"Not Granted\" }}</span></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- Identification & Health -->\r\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Identification &amp; Health</div>\r\n  <div class=\"field-grid two-col\">\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Passport Number / National ID</label>\r\n      <span>{{ doc.passport_number | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"field\"><label>Health Details</label>\r\n      <span>{{ doc.custom_health_details | default(\"\u2014\") }}</span></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Signatures -->\r\n  <div class=\"sig-block\">\r\n    <div class=\"sig\">Employee Signature</div>\r\n    <div class=\"sig\">HR Department Signature &amp; Stamp</div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"footer-note\">\r\n    Al Ihsan Specialist Hospital \u2014 Human Resources Department &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n    This document is system-generated and confidential. For internal HR use only.\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</div>",
